---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy — Peptides Source Hub" description="Peptides Source Hub privacy policy — GDPR-compliant. How we collect, use, and protect your B2B information. No third-party sharing. Contact aaron@senobiocorp.com for data requests.">
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow mx-auto px-4">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <div class="card bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-white border-green-200 mt-6 p-5">
      <h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-3">Our Privacy Promise</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">We process B2B data for legitimate business purposes only. <strong>We never sell, rent, or share your data with third parties.</strong> No ad networks. No data brokers. No marketing affiliates.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-gray-700">
      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you contact Peptides Source Hub — via our website, email, WhatsApp, Telegram, or at trade shows — we may collect: your name, company/institution name, job title, email address, phone number, shipping address, and project/order requirements. We also maintain records of correspondence, quotes, orders, and invoices for legitimate business purposes.</p>
        <p class="mt-2">Our website uses no tracking cookies, no analytics scripts, and no third-party pixels. We do not collect IP addresses or browsing behavior.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Your information is used <strong>exclusively</strong> for:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-5 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li>Responding to product inquiries and providing quotes</li>
          <li>Processing and fulfilling orders</li>
          <li>Issuing Certificates of Analysis and compliance documentation</li>
          <li>Providing ongoing technical support related to your orders</li>
          <li>Sending order confirmations, shipping updates, and invoices</li>
          <li>Meeting legal and regulatory record-keeping obligations</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">We may occasionally send relevant product updates to existing customers — you can opt out anytime by replying "unsubscribe."</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">3. Data Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
        <p>We share your data with third parties only when <strong>strictly necessary</strong> to fulfill your order:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-5 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li>Shipping carriers (DHL, FedEx, UPS, TNT) — name, address, phone for delivery</li>
          <li>Payment processors — transaction data for payment settlement</li>
          <li>Customs authorities — commercial invoice data as required by law</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">We do <strong>not</strong> share data with marketing companies, data brokers, advertising networks, analytics providers, or any other third party not listed above.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">4. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures: encrypted email communication (TLS), access-controlled file storage, and role-based data access limited to personnel who need it for your order. No credit card data is stored on our servers — all payment processing is handled by PCI-DSS compliant processors.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">5. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain order records (including associated contact information) for a minimum of <strong>5 years</strong> as required for tax and regulatory compliance. Correspondence records are retained for 3 years. You may request deletion of non-mandatory records at any time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">6. Your Rights (GDPR & Similar)</h2>
        <p>Regardless of your jurisdiction, we honor these rights for all customers:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-5 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the data we hold about you</li>
          <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
          <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion where not required for legal compliance</li>
          <li><strong>Objection:</strong> Object to processing for direct marketing</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">To exercise any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:aaron@senobiocorp.com" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">aaron@senobiocorp.com</a>. We'll respond within 30 calendar days.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">7. International Data Transfers</h2>
        <p>Our operations are based in Shenzhen, China. By engaging with us, you acknowledge that your data may be processed in China. We apply the same data protection standards to all data regardless of origin.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">8. Policy Updates</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page indicates the most recent revision. Material changes will be communicated to active customers via email.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">9. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related inquiries: <a href="mailto:aaron@senobiocorp.com" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">aaron@senobiocorp.com</a> | WhatsApp: +64 20 431 0558 | Telegram: @DrAaronWang</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
<div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 text-sm text-gray-500">
      <span>Related: </span>
      <a href="/terms/" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">Terms & Conditions</a> &middot;
      <a href="/shipping/" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">Shipping Policy</a> &middot;
      <a href="/contact/" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
</section>
</PageLayout>